# Guest pieces (0.17.80): two players' pieces from the Library are the factory pieces of their places, with their titles and makers:
# FUNK 10 is Golfhole's "Funky Space Jam", HOUSE 09 Roj's "About last night". Their settings are the records as shared (the tempo:
# 106 and 123, where the generated pieces had their own); SEL + SAVE held on Global brings them back like any factory piece.
seed 0
wait 3000
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET 11
wait 200
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 11
turn PRESET 9
wait 400
expect piece 9
expect tempo 106
shot guest_funk10.png
tap GLO
wait 300
shot guest_funk10_global.png
# changed and brought back to factory: the guest piece again
turn K1 20
wait 300
press SEL
press SAVE
wait 2000
release SAVE
release SEL
wait 300
expect tempo 106
expect saved 0
# HOUSE 09: Roj's
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET -9
wait 200
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 2
turn PRESET -1
wait 400
expect piece 8
expect tempo 123
shot guest_house09.png
